    "talent": [
      {
        "key": "玄鸞畫水",
        "title": "玄鸞畫水",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/11/84496276/1ce09211f025bf5470682189e0837732_6606722197437864557.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>普通攻擊</color>\n造成1點 <color=#80ffd6>風元素傷害</color> 。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": null
      },
      {
        "key": "鳳縷隨翦舞",
        "title": "鳳縷隨翦舞",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/11/84496276/7d8242d635777d2edb6019b0d536bb35_5427438092853788985.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>元素戰技</color>\n生成2層 <color=#ffffff>鳳縷護盾</color> ，獲得1層 <color=#ffffff>高效切換</color> ，並造成1點 <color=#80ffd6>風元素傷害</color> ，如果此技能引發了擴散，則額外生成1層 <color=#ffffff>鳳縷護盾</color> 。\n<color=#ffffff>鳳縷護盾</color>\n<color=#ffd680>出戰狀態</color>\n為我方出戰角色提供 <color=#ffffff>1點護盾</color> 。（可疊加，沒有上限）"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "鶤弦踏月出",
        "title": "鶤弦踏月出",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/11/84496276/b1c20842289e91360721949ac35f757a_6859914990625789423.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>元素爆發</color>\n造成3點 <color=#80ffd6>風元素傷害</color> ，生成2層 <color=#ffffff>鳳縷護盾</color> 。\n<color=#ffffff>鳳縷護盾</color>\n<color=#ffd680>出戰狀態</color>\n為我方出戰角色提供 <color=#ffffff>1點護盾</color> 。（可疊加，沒有上限）"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "風元素傷害",
        "title": "風元素傷害",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/11/84496276/c97292d96456bfe4abeca16bfce801e4_3459480026381325301.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "和已附著的元素發生元素反應：\n【 <color=#80ffd7>風元素</color> + <color=#99ffff>冰元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>擴散（冰）</color> ：對目標以外的所有敵方角色造成1點冰元素傷害\n【 <color=#80ffd7>風元素</color> + <color=#80c0ff>水元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>擴散（水）</color> ：對目標以外的所有敵方角色造成1點水元素傷害\n【 <color=#80ffd7>風元素</color> + <color=#ff9999>火元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>擴散（火）</color> ：對目標以外的所有敵方角色造成1點火元素傷害\n【 <color=#80ffd7>風元素</color> + <color=#ffacff>雷元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>擴散（雷）</color> ：對目標以外的所有敵方角色造成1點雷元素傷害"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "規則解釋",
        "title": "規則解釋",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/11/84496276/07bae546ac7c69ef6402170b283840c5_6182760513925693302.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffffff>護盾</color>\n<color=#ffd680>出戰狀態</color>\n為我方出戰角色提供 <color=#ffffff>1點護盾</color> 。（可疊加）\n<color=#ffffff>護盾</color>\n此護盾所保護的角色受到傷害時，將會消耗護盾來抵消傷害。\n<color=#ffffff>高效切換</color>\n<color=#ffd680>出戰狀態</color>\n<color=#ffffff>我方下次執行「切換角色」行動時：</color> 少花費1個元素骰。（可疊加，沒有上限）"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      }
    ]
  }
